WEBVTT

01:12.270 --> 01:12.970
Haumea.

01:12.970 --> 01:13.910
Shut up!

01:13.910 --> 01:15.520
Don't say a word.

01:22.310 --> 01:23.180
Let's go.

01:23.530 --> 01:25.850
We're meeting up with the others.

01:26.950 --> 01:27.870
Right.

01:34.580 --> 01:37.500
We will guide the empire to its true form.

