human experimentation facility in the Nether.

05:07.170 --> 05:09.280
We received their request and 
joined the investigation.

05:09.790 --> 05:12.340
The joint investigation of the 2nd, 8th,

05:12.340 --> 05:16.530
and First Lieutenant Takigi 
Oze of the Imperial Army

05:16.530 --> 05:20.540
discovered the White Clad's plan to destroy 
the ground under the Tokyo Empire.

05:20.540 --> 05:22.200
That plan was successfully stopped.

05:38.640 --> 05:41.270
