06:14.720 --> 06:19.560
Asakusa and Haijima have both 
promised us their cooperation.

06:19.560 --> 06:24.160
You're saying that this disunited 
empire is at last becoming one.

06:24.160 --> 06:27.790
This time, the connections 
will be strong ones.

06:31.390 --> 06:34.350
Very good, Obi! Well done!

06:34.350 --> 06:38.090
If the empire aligns with the 
Special Fire Force at its center,

06:38.090 --> 06:42.210
it will be a huge step forward in unraveling 
the mystery of spontaneous human combustion!

06:42.480 --> 06:46.180
We formed the 8th, and now 
we've finally made it this far.

06:46.180 --> 06:49.240
This is all thanks to your support, Chief.

06:49.240 --> 06:52.520
No, Obi, the credit goes to you.

06:52.520 --> 06:55.190
Thank you for uniting the empire.

06:55.190 --> 06:57.100
We still have a long way to go.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.640
It seems noisy out there, doesn't it?

07:07.770 --> 07:09.020
Excuse the interruption.

07:09.020 --> 07:10.570
We're from the Tokyo Imperial Army.

07:10.860 --> 07:13.750
I am currently fulfilling my duty 
to report to the Fire Chief.

07:13.750 --> 07:15.670
What business could the 
army possibly have here?

07:16.160 --> 07:19.810
Akitaru Obi, you will come with us.

07:19.810 --> 07:22.980
Please, don't resist. 
I will put these handcuffs—

07:22.980 --> 07:23.880
You're taking him in?!

07:23.880 --> 07:25.030
What's the meaning of this?!

07:25.030 --> 07:27.740
It's all right. This must 
be some sort of mistake.

07:27.740 --> 07:30.180
Please tell Hinawa about this.

07:39.160 --> 07:41.740
Why are the White Clad here?!

07:41.980 --> 07:44.980
<b>Fire Force</b>

07:41.980 --> 07:44.980
<b>Chapter 3</b>

07:44.980 --> 07:47.980
<b>Fire Force</b>

07:44.980 --> 07:47.980
<b>Chapter 3</b>

07:54.780 --> 07:56.000
Stop there!

08:02.720 --> 08:03.570
Stupid knight!

08:03.570 --> 08:05.950
What'd you say, stupid devil?!

08:05.950 --> 08:10.460
I, the Knight King, shall seal you away!
You should be grateful, Devil!

08:10.460 --> 08:12.520
I'm not a devil! I'm a hero!

08:12.520 --> 08:13.840
Hey! Both of you!

08:23.500 --> 08:25.200
Seriously?

08:25.200 --> 08:26.400
Sister!

08:26.400 --> 08:29.510
Please use that thing you got from Vulcan.

08:29.510 --> 08:30.980
Understood!

08:30.980 --> 08:32.150
Látom!

08:32.620 --> 08:33.670
Stupid kni—

08:36.190 --> 08:40.960
Looks like that thing I made just 
in case ended up coming in handy.

08:43.190 --> 08:46.300
Going to Asakusa has really helped 
you improve, Tamaki-chan.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.330
Thank you so much!

08:48.330 --> 08:50.730
Though it looks like your lecher 
lure is the same as always.

08:52.500 --> 08:54.340
Sorry about that.

08:54.340 --> 08:58.640
But you were able to defeat that person who 
attacked you in the Nether, weren't you?

08:58.640 --> 08:59.770
Assault, wasn't it?

08:59.770 --> 09:01.440
No, that was just...

09:04.680 --> 09:06.630
He did that on his own.

09:06.630 --> 09:08.530
It's very reassuring.

09:08.530 --> 09:13.070
Shinra and Arthur also seem to have 
acquired new techniques in Asakusa.

09:17.740 --> 09:22.780
Yes. Shinra says he imagines death to draw on 
the hysterical strength found at a fire site.

09:23.040 --> 09:25.360
Does Arthur-san visualize death, too?

09:25.360 --> 09:28.740
No. I asked Arthur about his, and...

09:30.680 --> 09:33.350
How did I access my hysterical 
strength, you ask?

09:34.050 --> 09:36.890
When I imagined possessing all 
the most powerful equipment

09:35.760 --> 09:39.010
<b>Quite unfortunately, the data from slot 1 has disappeared.
 Take a moment to collect yourself, 
and then let's try again!</b>

09:36.890 --> 09:39.550
and having all my stats maxed, 
and then the game data disappeared...

09:39.010 --> 09:41.180
<b>Begin adventure</b>

09:39.010 --> 09:41.180
<b>Adjust settings</b>

09:39.550 --> 09:40.480
I was able to access it.

09:43.850 --> 09:47.330
They do say there's only a hairsbreadth 
separating idiocy from genius.

09:47.330 --> 09:51.620
Yes, Arthur is definitely a genius at idiocy.

10:10.460 --> 10:13.410
Ever since the Great Cataclysm,

10:13.790 --> 10:19.560
the people of the Tokyo Empire have lived 
in fear of spontaneous human combustion.

10:20.170 --> 10:25.840
Now is the time for the empire to 
be reborn. It must unite as one.

10:28.810 --> 10:32.770
<b>Special Fire Grand Cathedral 1</b>

10:33.480 --> 10:34.860
At the Curia?

10:35.180 --> 10:37.690
We've been told to appear there at once.

10:37.690 --> 10:40.700
I wonder why they'd 
summon all of us together.

10:40.700 --> 10:43.580
Something big must have happened.

10:47.250 --> 10:50.460
<b>The Curia</b>

10:48.370 --> 10:50.460
I've been waiting for you...

10:50.460 --> 10:53.360
Captain Leonard Burns.

10:54.500 --> 10:57.300
What business do you have for us?

11:00.570 --> 11:02.760
Up to this point,

11:02.760 --> 11:08.930
the empire has been unable to move as one 
due to the many powers gathered within it.

11:15.660 --> 11:20.650
Now, however, there is a 
true need for unification.

11:20.960 --> 11:23.160
For the sake of the empire.

11:24.990 --> 11:28.650
And for the sake of our god, Sol.

11:31.230 --> 11:34.520
With them by our sides, we will become one.

11:41.100 --> 11:46.520
As possessors of the Adolla Burst,
they are true believers of our god, Sol.

11:46.520 --> 11:48.720
They are enemies of the empire!

11:48.720 --> 11:50.800
Raffles-sama, come here, quickly!

11:50.800 --> 11:55.030
Is it really that strange for us to be here,

11:55.030 --> 11:56.860
Leonard Burns?

11:56.160 --> 11:57.570
Of course it is!

11:57.570 --> 11:59.730
The land below ground suits 
you all much better!

11:59.730 --> 12:02.410
We've simply returned to 
the place where we belong.

12:04.610 --> 12:08.530
Traitors, you will leave this sacred place!

12:08.820 --> 12:11.380
Stand back, Haumea. Stay behind me.

12:10.610 --> 12:11.740
It's fine.

12:11.740 --> 12:14.890
I'll fiddle with my own 
brain and speak seriously.

12:16.470 --> 12:18.640
This is the Curia!

12:18.640 --> 12:21.030
This is the heart of the Holy Sol Temple.

12:21.030 --> 12:22.970
We have no intention of fighting here.

12:23.300 --> 12:26.170
We have simply come here to talk.

12:26.170 --> 12:29.390
You come in here still wearing your dirty 
outside shoes, and you're saying <i>what</i>?

12:29.390 --> 12:30.450
Karim!

12:30.450 --> 12:33.610
As they said, this is the Curia.

12:37.810 --> 12:41.060
If you don't intend to fight, 
then why have you come here?

12:41.750 --> 12:43.130
What are you after?

12:44.860 --> 12:45.450
<b>"OTHER
WORLD"</b>

12:45.110 --> 12:49.740
<i>Other World. Evangelist. God. 
Holy Mother. Adolla Link.</i>

12:45.450 --> 12:46.030
<b>"Evangelist"</b>

12:46.410 --> 12:47.030
<b>"God"</b>

12:47.120 --> 12:47.870
<b>"Holy Mother"</b>

12:47.870 --> 12:48.950
<b>"Adolla Link"</b>

12:49.740 --> 12:53.650
<i>I'll read Burns' thoughts 
with my Talking Head.</i>

12:56.440 --> 13:01.410
Captain Burns, you've already 
realized, haven't you?

13:01.910 --> 13:03.170
Realized what?

13:02.720 --> 13:03.420
<b>"Wary"</b>

13:03.780 --> 13:07.860
That right eye that you've lost is 
the greatest proof of it, isn't it?

13:04.550 --> 13:05.380
<b>"Fear"</b>

13:05.430 --> 13:06.430
<b>"Sense of Duty"</b>

13:06.430 --> 13:07.140
<b>"Awareness"</b>

13:09.430 --> 13:13.320
You have seen the truth of this world.

13:11.970 --> 13:22.320
<b>"Refusal"</b>

13:13.320 --> 13:16.080
But you are unable to verify it.

13:14.140 --> 13:22.320
<b>"Interest"</b>

13:16.650 --> 13:22.320
<b>"Doubt"</b>

13:16.880 --> 13:23.180
Your goals as devout priests and 
ours are the same, I believe.

13:24.490 --> 13:28.100
You're saying we're the same? 
You can't just declare that!

13:27.200 --> 13:29.400
Do you mean Rekka Hoshimiya?

13:27.240 --> 13:29.410
<b>"Grudges"</b>

13:37.500 --> 13:43.550
<b>"Retrospection"</b>

13:37.500 --> 13:43.550
<b>"Regret"</b>

13:37.750 --> 13:43.550
Rekka Hoshimiya was a devout believer who 
fell following the path of evangelism.

13:43.550 --> 13:46.060
You people killed him, didn't you?

13:47.510 --> 13:51.730
In the pursuit of our great goals, 
it was a necessary sacrifice.

13:47.590 --> 13:51.720
<b>"Intent to Kill"</b>

13:48.050 --> 13:51.720
<b>"Rage"</b>

13:51.730 --> 13:54.920
What "great goals"?! You're just murderers!

13:54.920 --> 13:58.640
What value is there in 
morals created by humans?

13:55.020 --> 13:58.650
<b>"Hesitation"</b>

13:55.640 --> 13:58.650
<b>"Objection"</b>

13:56.060 --> 13:58.650
<b>"Resistance"</b>

13:59.430 --> 14:01.830
And you're saying you've 
had divine revelations?

14:01.830 --> 14:04.060
That's just you blabbering!

14:04.060 --> 14:08.030
Can't you feel it in the words we speak?

14:04.530 --> 14:08.030
<b>"Inquiry"</b>

14:05.190 --> 14:08.030
<b>"Analysis"</b>

14:08.650 --> 14:12.030
My words are spoken on behalf of our god!

14:12.200 --> 14:15.500
<b>"Recollection"</b>

14:12.350 --> 14:16.410
You should be able to sense in them a 
fragment of the will of the great cosmos.

14:22.930 --> 14:27.230
We know what your goal is. It's to 
recreate the Great Cataclysm, right?

14:27.230 --> 14:30.930
That is no more than the mechanism 
of our great objective.

14:27.380 --> 14:30.930
<b>"Despair"</b>

14:27.880 --> 14:30.930
<b>"Righteousness"</b>

14:28.090 --> 14:30.930
<b>"Rejection"</b>

14:31.310 --> 14:37.390
We, the followers of the Holy Sol Temple, 
seek only to follow the will of our god, Sol.

14:37.670 --> 14:40.480
The Great Cataclysm itself isn't the goal?

14:40.480 --> 14:44.670
And you're saying that our god,
Sol, wishes this?

14:43.980 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:43.980 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:44.190 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:44.320 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:44.530 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:44.530 --> 14:47.530
<b>"Confusion"</b>

14:50.190 --> 14:52.790
Captain Leonard Burns.

14:53.310 --> 14:57.040
In exchange for that right eye,
you must have seen it.

14:57.040 --> 14:59.560
The true state of this world...

14:57.080 --> 14:58.410
<b>"Insects"</b>

14:57.080 --> 14:58.620
<b>"Hell"</b>

14:57.580 --> 14:58.910
<b>"God"</b>

14:58.000 --> 14:59.420
<b>"Truth"</b>

14:58.290 --> 14:59.580
<b>"Rules"</b>

14:58.460 --> 14:59.920
<b>"Higher Dimension"</b>

14:58.830 --> 15:00.080
<b>"World"</b>

14:59.250 --> 15:00.080
<b>"Numbers"</b>

15:00.330 --> 15:02.230
and the future that is to come.

15:02.710 --> 15:05.460
<b>"Desire"</b>

15:03.500 --> 15:05.460
<b>"Curiosity"</b>

15:05.870 --> 15:08.550
What is your group's objective?

15:09.510 --> 15:09.630
<b>"Light"</b>

15:11.570 --> 15:14.970
To turn this watery world into a sun!

15:14.970 --> 15:18.400
Just as the sun did once before!

15:15.970 --> 15:17.430
<b>"Sun"</b>

15:21.100 --> 15:23.070
That's utterly ridiculous.

15:23.070 --> 15:25.970
You're really planning to 
burn this planet to a crisp?

15:25.970 --> 15:29.370
Prove your faith, Leonard Burns.

15:26.820 --> 15:31.450
<b>"God"</b>

15:29.890 --> 15:34.520
If you truly are as devout a priest 
as you say, you will have seen

15:32.910 --> 15:38.330
<b>"God"</b>

15:34.520 --> 15:36.990
the complete otherworldliness of it.

15:34.800 --> 15:35.850
God.

15:38.990 --> 15:41.000
Absolute correct judgment.

15:41.950 --> 15:43.910
Absolute blind devotion.

15:45.840 --> 15:48.470
Release beyond the bounds 
of human knowledge.

15:49.040 --> 15:51.260
Divine madness.

16:12.740 --> 16:16.950
<b>"Conversion"</b>

16:22.740 --> 16:24.570
They took the captain?!

16:24.570 --> 16:27.540
As he was giving his report to the Fire 
Chief at the Fire Defense Agency,

16:27.540 --> 16:29.390
the army came and took him away.

16:29.790 --> 16:32.850
He is currently being detained 
under the army's observation.

16:34.410 --> 16:37.270
I was told that the White 
Clad were with the army.

16:38.250 --> 16:42.580
Which means that we should consider the 
captain to be captured by the White Clad.

16:42.580 --> 16:43.810
How can this be?

16:44.040 --> 16:46.860
Why would they take the captain?

16:46.860 --> 16:49.770
And why would the White Clad 
be cooperating with the army?

16:49.770 --> 16:53.930
The method by which the White Clad gained 
access to the heart of our empire is a mystery.

16:54.420 --> 16:59.580
But their objective must be the capture 
of Shinra, with his Adolla Burst.

17:01.350 --> 17:02.700
Draw!

17:02.700 --> 17:05.930
By offering Shinra as a living sacrifice,
I summon the captain!

17:05.930 --> 17:06.830
Hey!

17:06.830 --> 17:09.200
...is what I'd like to say, 
but I'd be okay with that.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.250
No!

17:10.250 --> 17:13.510
The 8th will never sell out its allies!

17:13.790 --> 17:17.120
It was Captain Obi himself who said that.

17:17.120 --> 17:21.020
Out of respect for his words,
 I will discard Shinra from my deck.

17:21.020 --> 17:23.680
You just really wanna get 
rid of me, don't you?

17:23.970 --> 17:27.640
We have to hurry. The army will 
show up here eventually, too.

17:27.640 --> 17:30.110
Those who wish to remain here should stay.

17:30.430 --> 17:33.100
I will prepare to rescue the captain.

17:33.560 --> 17:37.350
When I do, I will likely have 
to fight agents of the empire.

17:37.680 --> 17:39.820
If you do that, Lieutenant Hinawa...

17:39.820 --> 17:43.440
Yes, I will become a traitor.

17:43.440 --> 17:45.750
That's why I am acting 
as a private individual.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.150
I am not issuing an order.

17:49.370 --> 17:50.950
Those who would leave should leave!

17:50.950 --> 17:54.180
Once I am branded a rebel, I will 
no longer be your lieutenant.

17:54.180 --> 17:55.420
I'm going, too!

17:55.420 --> 17:58.270
That's obvious, isn't it? 
Let's save the captain!

17:58.270 --> 18:00.730
I'm going, too! It's a knight's...

18:02.450 --> 18:03.630
I'm going!

18:03.630 --> 18:05.090
A knight should...

18:05.910 --> 18:08.790
What is it again?
A knight... would save him!

18:08.790 --> 18:11.180
Lieutenant, you'll always be our lieutenant!

18:11.180 --> 18:12.310
Don't try to run away from that!

18:12.310 --> 18:14.150
Please don't say such sad things!

18:14.150 --> 18:15.910
Lieutenant!

18:14.150 --> 18:16.360
We love the captain!

18:16.350 --> 18:17.830
Pipe down!

18:18.790 --> 18:22.100
Maki, you have a home to go back to.

18:21.400 --> 18:25.200
I set my heart on being a 
fire soldier in the 8th.

18:25.200 --> 18:28.720
Say any more and I'll get angry at you,
even if you are my lieutenant.

18:30.660 --> 18:34.220
Tamaki, don't force yourself. 
You've got family.

18:36.040 --> 18:38.380
I don't wanna be labeled a traitor...

18:38.870 --> 18:40.840
but you're all going, right?

18:41.160 --> 18:42.880
So I'm going, too!

18:42.880 --> 18:44.140
That's a good enough reason?

18:44.390 --> 18:47.410
I'm not just getting swept along 
by what the rest of you think.

18:47.410 --> 18:49.470
I'm not just meekly going with the flow!

18:49.600 --> 18:57.700
BOOM

18:49.760 --> 18:53.010
I am determined! And if everyone 
is going, then so am I!

18:53.010 --> 18:54.420
Let's go!

18:54.880 --> 18:57.690
She's saying meek things very forcefully.

18:58.890 --> 19:00.860
We are the Fire Force!

19:00.860 --> 19:02.870
We are always ready to move, right?

19:02.870 --> 19:04.100
You've got that right!

19:03.170 --> 19:05.350
This knight is always ready!

19:03.590 --> 19:04.690
Of course we are!

19:04.160 --> 19:06.840
Give our captain back, you jerks!

19:07.070 --> 19:09.580
Since their loyalty to 
the empire runs so deep,

19:09.580 --> 19:12.280
the 1st and 2nd will become your enemies.

19:12.790 --> 19:15.900
The 8th will be completely on its own.

19:16.550 --> 19:19.450
And yet no one is opting out.
That's impressive.

19:19.910 --> 19:21.880
That's the 8th for you!

19:22.160 --> 19:24.090
That's because the 8th is a family.

19:25.090 --> 19:28.270
Inspector Licht, what will you do?

19:29.690 --> 19:34.620
The 8th is chasing the mystery of spontaneous
human combustion, which threatens our world.

19:35.050 --> 19:38.670
I knew from the beginning that this meant

19:38.670 --> 19:40.930
the world would turn against you one day.

19:44.410 --> 19:49.690
You're going to become rebels against the 
world, so your next opponent will be...

19:56.120 --> 19:58.150
The Tokyo Empire.

21:49.030 --> 21:51.280
We've captured Akitaru Obi.

21:51.870 --> 21:53.270
Have you?

21:53.960 --> 21:59.190
Is the recapture of Shinra Kusakabe and his 
Adolla Burst the will of the Evangelist?

21:59.190 --> 22:00.150
Yes.

22:00.550 --> 22:04.240
Obi will be the bait that lures 
the Fourth Pillar to us.

22:04.750 --> 22:11.060
And he had a role in the development 
of Shinra's Adolla Burst.

22:11.060 --> 22:14.130
We must reward him appropriately, 
don't you think?

22:16.790 --> 22:20.200
He has devoted his life to our god, Sol.

22:20.200 --> 22:23.840
Let us bestow upon him the joy 
of returning to those flames.

22:30.610 --> 22:32.350
Akitaru Obi...

22:32.720 --> 22:34.690
shall be implanted with an Insect.

22:39.460 --> 22:41.960
<b>To Be Continued</b>

24:11.970 --> 24:13.470
<b>Fire Force Chapter 3</b>

24:13.470 --> 24:14.760
<b>Next Time</b>

24:14.680 --> 24:17.710
We can't afford to lose him here.

24:17.980 --> 24:21.400
The empire needs Obi.

24:22.020 --> 24:23.920
Next time, "Prisoner."

24:22.100 --> 24:22.140
<b>Prisoner</b>

24:22.100 --> 24:26.890
<b>Episode 2</b>

24:23.920 --> 24:26.600
Return to the great flame of fire. Látom.
